<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
    <div class="todo">
      <strong>Legal review recommended</strong>
      This is a plain-language starting point written to match how the site
      actually behaves. Have the client read it and confirm it is accurate for
      their operation before launch.
    </div>

    <h2>What this page covers</h2>
    <p>
      This notice applies to {{ site.url }}. It does not cover the information
      we collect on paper during enrollment, or information handled inside
      Brightwheel or ClassDojo, which have their own terms.
    </p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>
      If you fill in the tour request form, we receive what you type into it:
      your name, phone number, email address, your child's first name and age if
      you choose to give them, the program you are interested in, a preferred
      visit date, and your message.
    </p>
    <p>
      Please do not send medical details, diagnoses, or any government
      identification numbers through this form. Those belong on the enrollment
      paperwork we complete with you in person.
    </p>

    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <p>
      We use it to answer your enquiry and arrange a visit. We do not sell it,
      rent it, or share it with anyone outside the center for marketing.
    </p>

    <h2>Where it goes</h2>
    <p>
      Form submissions are delivered by our website host to the center's email
      inbox and are retained in the host's submission records. The site is
      served over an encrypted connection.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
    <p>
      This website sets no advertising or analytics cookies of its own and
      loads no analytics trackers.
    </p>
    <p>
      Our Locations and Home pages embed maps from Google Maps so you can see
      where each center is. Google may set cookies and record your IP address
      when one of those maps loads, under
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google's privacy policy</a>.
      Everything the maps show is also written out as plain text on the page,
      so you never need to interact with them.
    </p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>
      This website is written for parents and guardians. It is not directed at
      children, and we do not knowingly collect information submitted by a
      child.
    </p>

    <h2>Photographs</h2>
    <p>
      Photographs of enrolled children appear on this site only where a signed
      publicity release is on file. If you would like your child's image
      removed, contact us and we will take it down.
    </p>

    <h2>Contacting us</h2>
    <p>
      Write to <a href="mailto:{{ site.contact.email }}">{{ site.contact.email }}</a>
      or call either location with any question about this notice, or to ask us
      to delete an enquiry you have sent.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
